# Play test of Ashfall (CIPlay ashfall, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The table-land's top at 21.8 m: the road up from the landing (30 -50) in two legs (a turn at -23 -44.5, 12 m) to the square at 4 -30; the bell house
# at 0 -16 (deck 28.9 m); the town hall x -20.5..-13.5, z -14.5..-4 (door east at z -11..-7.5); the bakery round 14 -10
# (open on the north); the tool shed at 22 4 (open south); the school x 9.5..16.5, z 9.5..20 (door east at z 13..16.5);
# the crypt's stair from -10 8 down west to -21 8 (17.8 m); the goat path 18 28 - 32 42 - 16 53; the shelter round 1 45 (the lava tube dug from its mouth at z 52 back to 38).
island Ashfall
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Under the Ash
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
at 30 -50 h=2.6
walk 30 -50 to 17 -49 h=4.2
at 17 -49 h=5.2
walk 17 -49 to 4 -48 h=6.8
at 4 -48 h=7.8
walk 4 -48 to -9 -47 h=9.4
at -9 -47 h=10.4
walk -9 -47 to -21 -45.5 h=12.0
at -23 -44.5 h=13
walk -23 -44.5 to -24 -42 to -14.7 -39.3 to -5.3 -36.7 to 4 -34 h=21.8
walk 4 -34 to 4 -30 h=21.8
zone rooftops
expect step 1
use bell
expect message read her pages first
read The last proclamation
expect step 2
at -6 -9.2 h=23
walk -6 -9.2 to -16 -9.2 h=21.9
zone townhall
expect message full of rats
kill Rat
expect step 3
read Mayor's diary, page one
at 14 -5 h=23
walk 14 -5 to 14 -9.5 h=21.85
read Mayor's diary, page two
expect step 4
at 22 1 h=23
walk 22 1 to 22 2.6 h=21.8
open Tool shed box
expect story ashshovel 1
expect step 5
at 22 14.77 h=23
use schooldoor
expect message You dig
wait 4
walk 22 14.77 to 13 14.77 h=21.9
zone school
expect step 6
read Mayor's diary, page three
at -6 8 h=23
walk -6 8 to -22 8 h=17.8
zone chapel
expect message Beetles
read Mayor's diary, page four
expect step 7
kill Roach
expect step 8
at 0 -16 h=29.5
read Mayor's diary, page five
expect step 9
use bell
expect shown shelter
wait 6
at 18 28 h=23
walk 18 28 to 32 42 h=12
walk 32 42 to 16 53 h=2.2
walk 16 53 to 2 51 h=2
walk 2 51 to 1 45 h=2.05
zone shelter
expect step 10
read The shelter's roll
expect step 11
